\noindent \textbf{Description}

\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Management:} Receives management request.
\item \textbf{Management:} Reviews the request (Approval requests).
\item \textbf{Management:} Performs user management operations.
\item \textbf{System:} Validates the received request.
\item \textbf{Decision:} Request valid?
\begin{itemize}
\item Yes: Proceed to decision making.
\item No: Notify invalid request and terminate process.
\end{itemize}
\item \textbf{Management:} Performs decision making (Approve / Reject).
\item \textbf{Decision:} Approval granted?
\begin{itemize}
\item Yes: Proceed with update.
\item No: Notify rejection and terminate process.
\end{itemize}
\item \textbf{System:} Updates user status in the database.
\item \textbf{Decision:} User status updated?
\begin{itemize}
\item Yes: Send notifications to Tutor and Student.
\item No: Log error (update failed).
\end{itemize}
\item \textbf{Tutor / Student:} Receive notification.
\end{enumerate}